      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "The investigation accomplished results witness the hypoxic syndrome occurrence due to the stress-affection factor action. The lowering of the concentration chain of oxygen cascade with subsequent accumulation of lactic acid derivates constitutes the main mechanism of hypoxic syndrome pathogenesis. The impact of various intensive therapeutic schemes application on hypoxic markers and concentration indices of the oxygen cascade was established."},
